QuestGuidance.Register("en",412,{
[13153]="7004E6D8\n1\tLook for signs of Borin's battle with Etterfang\tYou should look for some sign of Borin's battle with Etterfang in the Glimmerdeep mine, west and north of Skarháld.\n2\tExamine the fallen rock\030Examine the large scratch\030Examine the spider corpse\030Make note of the fallen rock\030Make note of the large scratch\030Make note of the charred spider remains\tThe Glimmerdeep mine lies west then north of Skarháld. You should examine and make note of things in the Glimmerdeep that may be connected to the battle between Borin and Etterfang.\n3\tTalk to Rúni\tYou should talk to Rúni back at Skarháld.\n",
[13154]="7005466D\n1\tTalk to the Ungoladan\tThe Ungoladan that ambushed you has regained consciousness. You should talk to the Ungoladan.\n2\tComplete Instance: The Pale Herald\tFelgúr has a tale to tell about a dark man who came to lead his people astray. You should talk to Felgúr to hear the tale.\n3\tTalk to Felgúr\tFelgúr has one last thing to say to you. You should talk to Felgúr outside Cadar Skûs.\n4\tTalk to Legolas\tLegolas would like to discuss this new information with you. You should talk to Legolas outside Cadar Skûs.\n",
[13155]="700571AC\n1\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n2\tContinue learning the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n3\tFurther learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n4\tTalk to Léothred elsewhere at Framsburg\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n5\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n6\tTalk to Léothred elsewhere at Framsburg\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n7\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n8\tReturn to Hlithseld to rest\tHlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow. You should travel to Hlithseld and rest.\n9\tTalk to Léothred at Hlithseld\tHlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow. You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.\n",
[13156]="700442F1\n1\tInvestigate the body\tThe slain Easterling can be found on the roadside in Talath Anor. You should investigate the body.\n2\tSpeak with Tolwin\tTolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n",
[13157]="7000B297\n1\tTalk to Aranhir\tThe Captain of the Gilminuial may be found northward along the Baranduin. The cargo is strewn along the Brandywine River. Argirion asked you to seek out the Captain of the Gilminuial and recover as much of the ship's cargo as you can.\n2\tBring the lost cargo to Argirion\030Collect kegs of cram (total: 10)\030Collect bottles of ale (total: 25)\tArgirion is southward along the Brandywine River. The Captain of the Gilminuial bid you return to Argirion and let him know that the rest of the crew survived. He also asked that you fulfil Argirion's request and collect the cargo.\n",
[13158]="7006BCA1\n1\tFind the tortoise den\tAngârmu has asked that you seek out a mystical talking tortoise near Zikrum-dûl to the east along the river.\n2\tSpeak with the tortoise nearby\tYou found a tortoise at the den near Zikrum-dûl. Speak with it to see if it's the one Angârmu told you about.\n3\tTry speaking with a different tortoise in the area\tYou tried speaking to a tortoise at the den near Zikrum-dûl, but it turned out to be a generic tortoise. Speak with another to see if it's the one Angârmu told you about.\n4\tAttempt to speak with the tortoise\tYou found a slightly more interesting tortoise at the den near Zikrum-dûl. Try speaking with it to see if it's the one Angârmu told you about.\n5\tReturned to Angârmu with the tortoise\tReturn to Angârmu in Malgâma near Zikrum-dûl with the tortoise.\n",
[13159]="70071E05\n1\tSearch for clues left by the travellers (total: 5)\030Defeat Kighân toughs within Khatzâla (total: 6)\030Defeat Kighân marksmen within Khatzâla (total: 4)\030Defeat Kighân rat-keepers within Khatzâla (total: 3)\tSearch for clues as to the travellers' whereabouts... or their fate.\n2\tSearch for travellers near the rear of Khatzâla\tSearch for travellers near the rear of the cave.\n3\tSearch for travellers near the rear of Khatzâla\tSearch for travellers near the rear of Khatzâla.\n4\tFlee the cave before you are overtaken!\tYou hear a great screech from behind you. Run! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[13160]="7005874B\n1\tDefeat hobgoblin beast-tamers (total: 6)\tHobgoblin beast-tamers can be found at Howlers' Notch. You should defeat hobgoblin beast-tamers.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many hobgoblin beast-tamers.\n",
[13161]="700571AA\n1\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n2\tContinue learning the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n3\tFurther learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n4\tTalk to Léothred at Framsburg\tLéothred can be found at Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n5\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n6\tTalk to Léothred elsewhere at Framsburg\tLéothred can be found at Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n7\tTalk to Léothred at Framsburg\tLéothred can be found at Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n8\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n9\tTalk to Léothred at Framsburg\tLéothred can be found at Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n",
[13162]="7003E285\n1\tDefeat Tarkrîp Orcs at their encampments\tOrcs can be found at their encampments just north-east of Trestlebridge. You should defeat the Tarkrîp Orcs at their encampments.\n2\tDefeat Tarkrîp pickets (total: 4)\030Defeat Tarkrîp raiders (total: 4)\tOrcs can be found at their encampments just north-east of Trestlebridge. You should defeat the Tarkrîp Orcs at their encampments.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have cleared the Tarkrîp encampments threatening Trestlebridge.\n",
[13163]="7000018C\n1\tTalk to Éa\030Collect Tarnished Bracelet\030Talk to Lorniel\030Talk to Golodir\030Talk to Laerdan\030Talk to Fimreg\030Talk to Areneth\030Talk to Lunathron\030Talk to Húriel\030Talk to Thoriel\030Talk to Donaith\030Talk to Gormal\030Talk to Táni\030Talk to Throst\tTármunn Súrsa lies in the northern part of eastern Angmar. You should go to Tármunn Súrsa and question its inhabitants about the bracelet you found.\n",
[13164]="70061D05\n1\tSpeak with Captain-General Tordúr.\t\n",
[13165]="70056FB0\n1\tComplete tasks (total: 10)\tComplete tasks in Middle-earth.\n",
[13166]="70036B3E\n1\tSpeak to Bando Brandybuck to choose a race contestant\tSpeak to Bando Brandybuck and choose your favourite contestant for the next upcoming race.\n2\tObserve the race and cheer for your chosen participant.\t\n",
[13167]="7001AFA8\n1\tObserve the race to see if Burdy is victorious\tThe Taste of Hobbiton can be observed during the Summer Festival. You should watch the Taste of Hobbiton and see if Burdy Gamwich wins the race as you supposed.\n2\tTalk to Bando Brandybuck\tBando Brandybuck can be found at the Taste of Hobbiton. You should speak with Bando Brandybuck to collect your prize.\n",
[13168]="7001AFA7\n1\tObserve the race to see if Daffodilly is victorious\tThe Taste of Hobbiton can be observed during the Summer Festival. You should watch the Taste of Hobbiton and see if Daffodilly Hayward wins the race as you supposed.\n2\tTalk to Bando Brandybuck\tBando Brandybuck can be found at the Taste of Hobbiton. You should speak with Bando Brandybuck to collect your prize.\n",
[13169]="7001AFA9\n1\tObserve the race to see if Gladdy is victorious\tThe Taste of Hobbiton can be observed during the Summer Festival. You should watch the Taste of Hobbiton and see if Gladdy Chubb-Baggins wins the race as you supposed.\n2\tTalk to Dodder Bando Brandybuck\tBando Brandybuck can be found at the Taste of Hobbiton. You should speak with Bando Brandybuck to collect your prize.\n",
[13170]="7001AFAA\n1\tObserve the race to see if Mudric is victorious\tThe Taste of Hobbiton can be observed during the Summer Festival. You should watch the Taste of Hobbiton and see if Mudric Rumble wins the race as you supposed.\n2\tTalk to Bando Brandybuck\tBando Brandybuck can be found at the Taste of Hobbiton. You should speak with Bando Brandybuck to collect your prize.\n",
[13171]="7004DA35\n1\tDefeat Taurogrim in Tholkát (total: 15)\tTaurogrim can be found in Tholkát in northern Eryn Lasgalen. You should defeat Taurogrim in Tholkát.\n2\tTalk to Thranduil\tThranduil can be found in Felegoth. You should talk to Thranduil.\n",
[13172]="7000D1AA\n1\tSpeak with Clar Whitethorn in Bree-town\tBring the Clar's Work Order to Clar Whitethorn in Bree. He can be found across the street from the weapon and armour shop in western Bree-town.\n",
[13173]="7004D095\n1\tDrink some ale\tYou should have a drink while you wait for Górsim, in Erebor.\n2\tSearch for Górsim\tGórsim can be found at one of the older vaults in Erebor.\n3\tTalk to Górsim\tYou should talk to Górsim, who can be found down in the vaults in Erebor.\n4\tTalk to Fróthi\tYou should speak with the lore-master Fróthi, who can be found in Erebor.\n",
[13174]="7006832B\n1\tDeliver Marâkh to Ithurga\tHûrlub has given you the tempest hammer and explains that he must rest now.\n",
[13175]="7006AECF\n1\tApproach the entrance to Jâx Ugikh\tTravel to Jâx Ugikh and explore the grand stair entrance\n2\tDefeat cultists near Jâx Ugikh (total: 12)\tSeek out and drive off cultists located near Jâx Ugikh.\n3\tTalk to Azrât in Kên Taghlim\tTravel to Kên Taghlim located north of Jâx Ugikh and inform Azrât that some of the cultists have been driven off.\n",
[13176]="70071E92\n1\tSpeak with Quartermaster Semanísi in Jiret-menêsh\tAfter speaking with Tirukêni, he directed you to speak with Quartermaster Semanísi. He will provide further information in how we can assist the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh.\n2\tSpeak with Tirukêni in Jiret-menêsh\tQuartermaster Semanísi informed you of how you can assist the Temámir and bid you return to Tirukêni for final instruction.\n",
[13177]="700097BF\n1\tDefeat Salamander-dam\030Defeat Salamander-sire\tThe two original salamanders can be found in the cellar of Tollobel, on Tyl Ruinen. Humfrey Rumming confided in you that he was the one responsible for the plague of salamanders on Tyl Ruinen and gave you the key to the cellar where he trapped the two original creatures. He asked you to slay the two originals to help reduce their numbers.\n2\tBring cellar key to Humfrey Rumming\tHumfrey Rumming is by the ruins of Tollobel on Tyl Ruinen. Humfrey Rumming is waiting to hear of your victory over the two original salamanders he brought to Tyl Ruinen.\n3\tTalk to Calatherdir at Tinnudir\tCalatherdir is at the Ranger-camp on the island of Tinnudir, east of Tyl Ruinen. Having learned the origin of the salamanders and helped to slow their proliferation, you should return to Calatherdir to tell him the tale of your deeds.\n",
[13178]="70016B33\n1\tArnfinn was last seen heading east towards Jazârgund. Búkk fears for the safety of one of his friends, Arnfinn who was last seen venturing out to find information about Mazog and the Orcs of Moria.\t\n2\tTalk to Búkk at Tharâkh Bazân\tBúkk is at Tharâkh Bazân to the west of Jazârgund. Búkk will be pleased to know that Arnfinn is safe.\n",
[13179]="7002EA78\n1\tHear out Cíllan's gesture of welcome\tCíllan, wife of the Thane, can be found in the Mead Hall of Langhold. You should speak with Cíllan to receive a formal Rohirrim welcome.\n2\tDrink the mead of Langhold\030Eat the bread of Langhold\tYou have been offered food and drink by the kind wife of Thane Utred. You should pledge your goodwill to the folk of Langhold by partaking of their mead and bread.\n3\tBow to Cíllan to thank her for her hospitality\tCíllan stands in the Mead Hall of Langhold. You should bow to Cíllan to thank her for her kindness and her greeting. This quest requires emotes. You must select the intended target and perform the emote.\n4\tReturn to Thane Utred\tThane Utred is in the Mead Hall of Langhold. You should return to the Thane now that you have received the proper welcome of his house.\n5\tNow that you are a guest, find a task or errand in Langhold\tNow that you have received the welcome of Thane Utred, you should venture out into Langhold to find something to do. Surely some of the townsfolk or guards could use some help from a seasoned traveller such as yourself.\n",
[13180]="7001C676\n1\tDefeat the greedy morroval-thief\030Collect the priceless Elf-treasure\tThe primary thief among the merrevail can be found in Dannenglor, north of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks. You should confront the morroval who hoards the priceless Elf-treasure and attempt to reclaim it for the Elves.\n2\tTalk to Mírdiniel at the Haunted Inn\tMírdiniel awaits you at the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, south of Dannenglor. You should bring the priceless Elf-treasure to Mírdiniel so that she may send it to be kept by the Galadhrim in Lothlórien, where it will remain safe as long as the Elves exist to watch over it.\n",
[13181]="70009E0C\n1\tDefeat Veteran Tomb-robber (total: 10)\030Defeat Scouting Tomb-robber (total: 10)\tTomb-robbers have established a camp on Rantost, an island north of Tinnudir on Lake Nenuial. Eliot Bencroft wants you to defeat a few tomb-robbers.\n2\tTalk to Eliot Bencroft on Rantost\tEliot Bencroft is at the south-east corner of Rantost. Eliot Bencroft will be pleased to hear the island has been thinned.\n",
[13182]="70015E1A\n1\tFind half-orcs bearing the item from the Company's camp-site\tThe half-orcs were seen to the east and a little south of Echad Eregion, almost due south of the Company's camp-site. Golgallon told you to hunt down the half-orcs and recover whatever they took from the camp-site.\n2\tTalk to Golgallon at Echad Eregion\tGolgallon is at Echad Eregion, west and north of where you found Thlûk. You should return to Golgallon with tidings of your encounter with Thlûk.\n",
[13183]="70019D31\n1\tFind the stolen pipe-weed pouch\tThe shrew ran off to the north of the Company's Pavilion. A shrew has run off with Pippin's pipe-weed pouch, and you should find it before the hobbit awakes.\n2\tBring the stolen pipe-weed pouch to Gladmeldis\tGladmeldis is at the Company's Pavilion in Caras Galadhon. You have recovered Pippin's pipe-weed pouch and should bring it to Gladmeldis at once.\n",
[13184]="7004A382\n1\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n2\tSearch abandoned packs (total: 20)\tSearch abandoned soldiers' packs in the valley and camps of Udûn.\n3\tCompleted\tSearched many abandoned soldiers' packs.\n",
})
